{"symbol":"SAB.MC","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:21:14Z","info":{"address1":"Plaça de Sant Roc núm. 20","city":"Sabadell","zip":"08201","country":"Spain","website":"https://www.grupbancsabadell.com","industry":"Banks - Diversified","industryKey":"banks-diversified","industryDisp":"Banks - Diversified","sector":"Financial Services","sectorKey":"financial-services","sectorDisp":"Financial Services","longBusinessSummary":"Banco de Sabadell, S.A. provides banking products and services in Spain, the United Kingdom, and Mexico. The company offers retail banking products, including investment products and medium- and long-term finance, such as consumer loans, mortgages, leasing and rental services, as well as other short-term finance; and cards and insurance products to individuals for personal use. It also provides financial products and services comprising investment and financing products, which include working capital products, revolving loans, and medium- and long-term finance; and custom structured finance and capital market solutions, and specialized advice for businesses; and cards and PoS terminals, as well as import and export and personalized expert advice services to companies and self-employed persons. In addition, the company offers corporate banking services consisting of financial and advisory solutions to large corporations and financial institutions; and structured finance, treasury, investment banking, trading, and custody and research services. Further, it provides current and savings accounts, loans, credit cards, and mortgages; and banking and financial services for corporate and commercial banking. Banco de Sabadell, S.A. was founded in 1881 and is based in Sabadell, Spain.","fullTimeEmployees":13749,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Josep  Oliu Creus ED, Ph.D.","age":76,"title":"Executive Chairman of the Board","yearBorn":1949,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1634000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Da